        "id": 82375,
        "name": "Air Guitar Warrior for Kinect",
        "summary": "Step inside the game and become a legendary Air Guitar Warrior with the power of Kinect! Play air guitar and control the music in this blend of music game and arcade action. Includes 19 custom-made tracks from Mr. Fastfinger and Samppa Siurala.\n\nShoot bullets, lasers and lightning from your air guitar! Ride dinosaurs, sharks and jet-powered crocodiles! Smash vikings, aliens, demons and flying skulls!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2isq.jpg",
        "release_date": 1490745600,
        "rating": 90.0,
