      {
        "id": 83810,
        "name": "Korgan",
        "summary": "Korgan is an episodic dungeon-crawler game. \n \nWhile playing the story mode you can switch your character in real time to face different kind of enemies or obstacles. \n \nCombine their abilities: freeze an enemy with the Mage, switch your character to Warrior and finish him with brute force, or perhaps shoot him from a safe range with the Hunter? Each character have their own abilities, strengths and weakness.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2qin.jpg",
